WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Brother Ling

2
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:02,560
How about we find the great man first?

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:05,280
Let’s move forward while the team is still intact.

4
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:06,680
What if we encounter another monster?

5
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,920
A great man is stabbed again

6
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,360
Then there is really no way to survive. How can I find it?

7
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,800
I remember the blood of great men is black

8
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:15,190
Since the blood of great men is black

9
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:17,310
Then let each of us bleed a little bit.

10
00:00:17,590 --> 00:00:19,190
Kill whoever is black

11
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:24,530
Why are you thinking too simply?

12
00:00:24,850 --> 00:00:26,050
A great man only becomes seriously injured

13
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:28,210
Or your blood will turn black when you freeze to death

14
00:00:28,930 --> 00:00:29,890
in daily life

15
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:34,090
Even if you cut your finger, there will still be red blood. How can you determine the time of school?

16
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,690
At that time Shen Cheng was hunting tentacles

17
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,330
The tentacle pierced her palm and blood flowed all over the floor.

18
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:39,610
all red

19
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,930
Unless everyone is seriously injured

20
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:43,610
Or freeze to death

21
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:45,610
Otherwise, bleeding is useless

22
00:00:46,660 --> 00:00:48,820
Who of you is willing to be chopped with a knife?

23
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:52,830
You can't do it if you don't want me to die.
